    "title": "California Retiree Loses $500,000 to Pig Butchering Scam, Then Falls for the Same Scam Again",
    "summary": "A California retiree who lost his $500,000 life savings to a romance scheme known as pig butchering has fallen for the same kind of scam all over again. Adan Look, a retired San Francisco city gardener, started chatting with a new online love interest right after the first scam wiped him out, reports ABC7 News. […]\nThe post California Retiree Loses $500,000 to Pig Butchering Scam, Then Falls for the Same Scam Again appeared first on The Daily Hodl.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://dailyhodl.com/2026/11/01/california-retiree-loses-500000-to-pig-butchering-scam-then-falls-for-the-same-scam-again/",
    "source": "The Daily Hodl",
    "tags": [
